					<Content>﻿<?ACE 4?>	See, for example, the case of Wikileaks, Netzpolitik, and other organizations and individuals sued for publicizing public documents. See Emily Cureton Cook, ‘Bend Sues Activist in Public Records Fight’, Oregon Public Broadcasting, 6 April 2021, https://www.opb.org/article/2021/04/05/bendsues-activist-in-public-records-fight (accessed 10 July 2023).﻿</Content>
